   443	| 1 (strings) | C-04, C-05, C-06 | XC-13 to XC-22, XC-28, XC-29 |
   444	| 2 (numbers) | N-01 to N-22 (RFC 8785 Appendix B), C-03, C-10, C-N01 to C-N22 | XC-03 to XC-12, XC-31 to XC-33, XF-27 |
